2 CONT * Estevão Vasques Filipe The journey of a warrior in the end of the Three Hundreds, by Miguel Gomes Martins, in Cadernos do Arquivo Municipal, nº 5, Lisbon, p. 24.
2 CONT * Santo Tirso Monastery, from 978 to 1588. The silhouette of an entity
