2 CONC ez de Guzmán (ca 1300 – Gibraltar, 1342), Master of the Order of Santiago, married ca 1330 to Dona Dona María de La Cerda, 1st Lady of Villafranca de Valcárcel (ca 1290 –), without issue.
2 CONT
