2 CONT 3.         MUNIO Rodríguez (-[1074/75]).  Conde [1030/33]. m firstly (before 1033) JIMENA Ordóñez, daughter of ORDOÑO Vermúdez de León & his wife Fronilde Peláez (-after 18 Sep 1042).  … Munio & his first wife had [four] children:
