2 CONT 1.         NUÑO Menéndez .  Maybe identified as the conde Núño Menéndez who was defeated and killed when he launched a rebellion against García King of Galicia in early 1071[3022].  He was named as father of Gómez and Fernando in 
2 CONC a charter issued by the latter 27 Dec 1127[3023].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m '''SANCHA Viegas''', daughter of ---.  Barton names Gómez Núñez as son of Nuño Menéndez and Sancha Viegas[3024].  Nuño & his wife had [three] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sancha Gomes de Sousa''' (c. 1035 -?), casada com Nuno de Celanova (c. 1030 - ?), filho de Sancho Nunes de Celanova (c. 1070 - c. 1130).[2]
