2 CONT Pedatura Lusitana 6 Vol. Cristovaoalao de Morais, Caravalhos de Basto 2nda Edicao Braga 1997
2 CONT Notes:
2 CONT Alfonso IX had many children with Aldonza Rodriguez de Silva, aka, Aldonza Martins da Silva.
2 CONT One of their sons, Rodrigo is the focus of the day because his Sire winds through many familiar houses and surnames. See Rodrigo:
2 CONT She was a Senora de Honor de Mansilla.
