2 CONT
2 CONT a.k.a. Fernando Ruiz de Castro http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fernando_Ruiz_de_Castro (wrong birthdate)
2 CONT
2 CONT From his mistress Mília Gonçalves, Lady of Assequins, he had one illegitimate son: D. Álvaro Pires de Castro, Lord of Alcáçovas - stem of a junior branch of the House of Castro in Portugal.
2 CONT
