1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pedro Apóstol de Castilla y Portugal1
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #241466
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=1 Aug 2007 Consanguinity Index=0.94%
2 CONT      Pedro Apóstol de Castilla y Portugal was born illegitimately.1 He is the son of Pedro de Castilla y Fonseca and Joanna de Aviz, Princeza de Portugal.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT  1.[S130] Wikipedia, online http;//www.wikipedia.org. Hereinafter cited as Wikipedia.
2 CONT
